[LINK: (June 5) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_5]  –  [LINK: (Claude, Duke of Chevreuse) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Claude,_Duke_of_Chevreuse]  (d.  [LINK: (1657) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1657] )

[LINK: (June 13) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_13]  –  [LINK: (Thomas Finch, 2nd Earl of Winchilsea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Finch,_2nd_Earl_of_Winchilsea] , Member of Parliament (d.  [LINK: (1639) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1639] )

